// Phaser  [audioEffect] — Tracktion's phaser rebuilt as a graph, so its three knobs can be AUTOMATED: the
// plugin keeps them as plain state, which no curve reaches. Same names, ranges and defaults as the plugin.
// Its DSP is described in jsdsp.ts beside this file, not compiled into the engine.
plugin({ type: "jsdsp", name: "Phaser" })
params({ Depth: 5, Rate: 0.4, Feedback: 0.7 })
// Four all-pass stages, their corner swept from 100 Hz up Depth octaves and back once every 1/Rate seconds, the last stage fed back into the input by Feedback and summed with the dry signal.
